stateDiagram-v2
    state "Waiting for review" as Waiting
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Waiting : open PR
    state Review {
        [*] --> Reading
        Reading --> Commenting
        Commenting --> [*]
    }
    Waiting --> Review
    Review --> Merged
    state check <<choice>>
    Merged --> check
    check --> [*] : released
    check --> Draft : reverted
